.TH REGEL-DAEMON 1 "September 2026" "regel-screensaver 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
regel-daemon \- Audio analysis and PipeWire background tap daemon for Regel screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regel-daemon
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBregel-daemon\fR is the background audio and physics processing daemon for the
Regel wallpaper and screensaver suite on KDE Plasma 6. It captures audio streams
from PipeWire or PulseAudio, computes SIMD-accelerated FFT frequency spectrums
(sub-bass, bass, mids, treble, transients), and coordinates simulation state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fIsource\fR
Audio source to capture. Values: \fBmonitor\fR (default, desktop audio output) or \fBmic\fR (default microphone).
.TP
\fB\-\-gain\fR \fIvalue\fR
Software gain multiplier for FFT sensitivity (default: 1.5).
.TP
\fB\-\-gamma\fR \fIvalue\fR
Dynamic range compression exponent (default: 1.2).
.TP
\fB\-\-auto-gain\fR
Enable adaptive dynamic range automatic gain control.
